# Amp orb files from Amplify (https://github.com/springloadedco/amplify) are committed; the rest of
# .agents/ and .amp/ is generated or per-machine. Directory entries such as `/.agents` must be the
# `/*` form below, because Git cannot re-include a file inside an ignored directory.
/.agents/*
!/.agents/setup
!/.agents/resume
/.amp/*
!/.amp/services.yaml
!/.amp/orb.env
!/.amp/php/
!/.amp/orb-proxy.mjs
!/.amp/vite.config.mjs
